 should be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the *invertible matrix theorem* states the following: \n\n*Let $A$ be an $n\\,\\times \\,n$ matrix. Then we have the following equivalence:*\n\n$$\nA\\text{ is invertible}\\,⇔\\,\\{\\,\\begin{aligned} & \\text{Col}(A)={R}^{n} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Col}(A))=n=\\text{rank}(A) \\\\  & \\text{Null}(A)=\\{0\\} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Null}(A))=0=\\text{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expression is $\\text{Null}(A).$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186446373 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124630 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "879514d5-e127-5485-ab41-d459f6b5f379" :knowledge-point/title "Recognizing Parts of the Invertible Matrix Theorem"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2557bc60-0ebd-5724-813e-5497b927e3ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Null}(A)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446316} {:answer/id #uuid "53b34189-99d5-5baf-aa84-89f8e9508140" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{dim(Col}(A))" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446320} {:answer/id #uuid "75e28f10-a377-5525-ba66-0cdc4c8e054e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "det(A)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446331} {:answer/id #uuid "cf0d1e39-a30f-5e91-abb1-770156247ed4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{rank}(A)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446346} {:answer/id #uuid "da7700e0-9e6b-592b-9d41-a202a3c36e62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Col}(A)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186446349}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "da7700e0-9e6b-592b-9d41-a202a3c36e62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{Col}(A)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592